<h2>What's New in 1.9.23</h2>  <ul><li><strong>Clearer Fable 5 and Claude usage-credit spending</strong> — AIQuota now shows Claude’s combined monthly usage-credit total separately from the 5-hour and 7-day plan limits. Variable costs are highlighted without guessing how much came from Fable 5 pay-as-you-go or usage after plan limits.</li> <li><strong>More reliable Claude sign-in</strong> — AIQuota now validates restored web sessions before using them. Expired sessions return to a clear Sign In state instead of repeatedly retrying stale cookies or leaving the popover stuck.</li></ul> <img src="https://github.com/niederme/ai-quota/releases/download/v1.9.23/AIQuota-1.9.23.png" alt="AIQuota 1.9.23" width="600">
